n","Sharonne Lanier","Alan Heckner","Selena Anduze","Samuel Lee Fudge","Walter Hendrix III","Ted Barba","Conphidance","Alexis Louder","Morgan Alexandria","Bella Samman","Peter Jang","Derek Russo","Jaylen Moore","Aaron Nedrick","Jessica Medina","Voltaire Colin Council","Orelon Sidney","Jacklyn Edney","Antwan Mills","Joseph Gray","Kevin Savage","Jeremi Farrar","Justin Farrar","Kathryn Kelly","Neva Howell","Graham Wolfe","Dexter Tillis","Kaileigh Bullard","Frank Stüdgens","Dustin Lewis","Amy Le","Bobby Jordan","Hayley McCarthy","Jonathan Horne","Mary Kraft","Kinsey Kunkel","Parker Wierling","Sam Ashby","Callie McClincy","Esmeree Sterling","Aleeah Rogers"],"screenwriters":["Michael Narducci","Marguerite MacIntyre","Kyle Arrington","Charlie Charbonneau","Carina Adly MacKenzie","Julie Plec","Jeffrey Lieber","Diane Ademu-John","Michelle Paradise","Ashley Lyle","Bart Nickerson","Talicia Raggs","Bianca Sams","Beau DeMayo","Declan De Barra","Eva McKenna","Christopher Hollier","Celeste Vasquez","K.C. Perry"],"cinematographers":["Michael C. Blundell","Darren Genet","Paul M. Sommers","Roger Chingirian","Kurt Jones"],"composers":["Michael Suby"],"reviews":[{"author":"Pavoll","text":"Najviac sa mi na tom pači že tam nenajdete žiadne kladne postavy, pretože sa da povedať že aj hlavne postavy su zaporaci. Konečne nejaka zmena oproti väčšine serialov, kde sa z hlavných predstaviteľov snažia spraviť neviem-akých hrdinov. V tomto serialy to nenajdete, tu sa nikto na svojej ceste za svojim cieľom nezastavi pred ničím. Dobre mi tam pasuje aj ta brutalita a krv lebo bez nich by to nebolo ono. Obľubené postavy: Rebekah, Elijah. 9/10(14.01.2015)","stars":5},{"author":"Knightey","text":"Na tenhle serial jsem zacal koukat spis z nudy. Nic pred tim, jsem na podobny styl nesledoval a nevidel. Bohuzel moje ostatni serialy nejsou uz a diky hodnoceni na CSFD jsem vybral tento. A nelituji. Je fakt ze prvnich par dilu jsem byl kompletne mimo ale postupem casu se to zlepsuje a obcas me dej mile prekvapi. Takze za me super na odreagovani u TV :)(26.08.2016)","stars":5},{"author":"Reesam","text":"Zatím seriál na slušné úrovni. A nejen proto, že mám slabost pro Niklause a jeho britský přízvuk. Jde o to, že v Upířích denících se vše točí kolem teen lásky, rozchodů a zase lásky a mezitím se něco děje. Ale v The Originals jde o víc. Má to děj, má to zápletky a vážně se na to koukáte s napětím a očekáváním, co bude dál. Je blbost to srovnávat s Deníky, ale je to tak, Původní jsou prostě vyšší úroveň.(10.11.2013)","stars":4}],"vods":[{"platform":"HBO Max","url":"https://www.hbomax.com/cz/en/shows/originals/f9cfda47-0083-417b-91eb-9acc7670314d"},{"platform":"Prime Video","url":"https://www.primevideo.com/detail/amzn1.dv.gti.22d4752e-bf37-46f4-98c2-6b9ade68c8a9"},{"platform":"Lepší.TV","url":"https://www.lepsi.tv/top_tv/serial/the-originals-online?utm_source=csfd&utm_content=csfd"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/342205-puvodni/prehled/","csfd_id":342205,"root_id":342205,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":5,"episode_count":92,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null,"episodes":[]}